 characters.\n\none of the strengths of the movie is its ability to balance the technical aspects of the story, such as the creation of the facebook algorithm, with the personal relationships between the characters. the film also does a good job of exploring the themes of friendship, loyalty, and the consequences of success.\n\noverall, the social network is a well-made and engaging film that tells a fascinating story. the movie is well-acted, well-written, and well-directed, and it does a good job of exploring the complexities of the characters and the themes of the story. if you're interested in the story of facebook and the people who founded it, then this movie is definitely worth watching.", "logprobs": [{"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0028232974000275135}, {"token": " social", "logprob": -0.10020723193883896}, {"token": " network", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.008624685928225517}, {"token": " a", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " film", "logprob": -0.18487101793289185}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.0005295066512189806}, {"token": " tells", "logprob": -0.39684411883354187}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " story", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00977491494268179}, {"token": " founding", "logprob": -0.014305301010608673}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " facebook", "logprob": -0.00012265883560758084}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.825939416885376}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": " subsequent", "logprob": -0.260613352060318}, {"token": " lawsuits", "logprob": -0.5478960275650024}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -1.2993727978027891e-05}, {"token": " followed", "logprob": -0.00117649941239506}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -2.7418097943154862e-06}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0029646276962012053}, {"token": " movie", "logprob": -5.125986263010418e-06}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.270293235778808